Dashboards & Alerts

This scales well from 100 to 5,000+ endpoints, supports Security, System, Application, PowerShell, Sysmon, and custom logs, and gives centralized search, dashboards, alerting, and compliance reporting.

Best option: Wazuh + Windows Event Forwarding

Components

Component	Role
Windows PCs / Servers	Generate event logs
Wazuh Agent	Collect logs and send securely
Windows Event Forwarding (WEF)	Native Microsoft log forwarding
Wazuh Server	Store, index, correlate, alert
OpenSearch Dashboard	Search and visualize events

For a banking environment, I would use WEF for native Windows log collection and Wazuh for SIEM and security analytics.

Server sizing (1,000 endpoints)

* OS: Rocky Linux 9 or Ubuntu Server 24.04
* CPU: 8-16 cores
* RAM: 32-64 GB
* Storage: 1-2 TB SSD (prefer RAID1/RAID10)
* Network: 1 Gbps minimum
* Retention: 90-180 days online

